rule no_arrow_inputs v1
description "A table whose heading has no `->` and names no output: every column is an input"

inputs
  amount : money[JPY]  range >=1JPY <=100_000JPY
  member : bool

outputs
  review : bool

table review_of
policy unique
| amount      | member |
| <10_000JPY  | -      |
| >=10_000JPY | true   |
| >=10_000JPY | false  |
